            "python": "p        7 is prime                  = T\nq        10 is even                  = T\nr        3 > 5                       = F\n~r       3 is not greater than 5     = T\np & r    7 is prime and 3 > 5        = F\np | r    7 is prime or 3 > 5         = T\nq -> r   if 10 is even then 3 > 5    = F\nr -> p   if 3 > 5 then 7 is prime    = T\np <-> q  7 is prime iff 10 is even   = T\nr -> p is vacuously true because r is false.\n\"x + 1 = 5\" is not a proposition until x is given a value.",
            "javascript": "p        7 is prime                  = T\nq        10 is even                  = T\nr        3 > 5                       = F\n~r       3 is not greater than 5     = T\np & r    7 is prime and 3 > 5        = F\np | r    7 is prime or 3 > 5         = T\nq -> r   if 10 is even then 3 > 5    = F\nr -> p   if 3 > 5 then 7 is prime    = T\np <-> q  7 is prime iff 10 is even   = T\nr -> p is vacuously true because r is false.\n\"x + 1 = 5\" is not a proposition until x is given a value.",
            "java": "p        7 is prime                  = T\nq        10 is even                  = T\nr        3 > 5                       = F\n~r       3 is not greater than 5     = T\np & r    7 is prime and 3 > 5        = F\np | r    7 is prime or 3 > 5         = T\nq -> r   if 10 is even then 3 > 5    = F\nr -> p   if 3 > 5 then 7 is prime    = T\np <-> q  7 is prime iff 10 is even   = T\nr -> p is vacuously true because r is false.\n\"x + 1 = 5\" is not a proposition until x is given a value."
