          "cpp": "A = {1, 2, 3}, B = {3, 4, 5}\nA intersect B = {3}\nA union B     = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5}\nA minus B     = {1, 2}\n|A union B| = |A| + |B| - |A intersect B| = 3 + 3 - 1 = 5\n|A x B| = 3 * 3 = 9 pairs\nP(A) has 2^3 = 8 subsets: {} {1} {2} {1, 2} {3} {1, 3} {2, 3} {1, 2, 3}\n<= on A: reflexive=yes antisymmetric=yes transitive=yes -> partial order\nf = {1->10, 2->20, 3->30}: injective? yes, onto {10, 20, 30}? yes"
