          "java": "5! = 120\nP(5,2) = 5!/3! = 20\nC(5,2) = 10\nbrute force: 10 two-element subsets of {1..5}\norder matters: P(5,2) = C(5,2) * 2! = 10 * 2 = 20\nexactly 2 heads among the 8 outcomes of 3 flips: THH HTH HHT\nP(exactly 2 heads in 3 fair flips) = 3/8 = 0.3750\nbinomial formula: C(3,2) * (1/2)^2 * (1/2)^1 = 3/8"
