            "python": "row 0: 1                  sum = 1 = 2^0\nrow 1: 1 1                sum = 2 = 2^1\nrow 2: 1 2 1              sum = 4 = 2^2\nrow 3: 1 3 3 1            sum = 8 = 2^3\nrow 4: 1 4 6 4 1          sum = 16 = 2^4\nrow 5: 1 5 10 10 5 1      sum = 32 = 2^5\nrow 6: 1 6 15 20 15 6 1   sum = 64 = 2^6\nPascal's rule: C(6,2) = C(5,1) + C(5,2) = 5 + 10 = 15\nsymmetry: C(6,2) = C(6,4) = 15\nC(30,15): Pascal table 155117520, multiplicative 155117520\nC(60,30): Pascal table 118264581564861424, multiplicative 118264581564861424\n(60! itself has 82 digits, so n!/(k!(n-k)!) cannot work in 64 bits)",
            "javascript": "row 0: 1                  sum = 1 = 2^0\nrow 1: 1 1                sum = 2 = 2^1\nrow 2: 1 2 1              sum = 4 = 2^2\nrow 3: 1 3 3 1            sum = 8 = 2^3\nrow 4: 1 4 6 4 1          sum = 16 = 2^4\nrow 5: 1 5 10 10 5 1      sum = 32 = 2^5\nrow 6: 1 6 15 20 15 6 1   sum = 64 = 2^6\nPascal's rule: C(6,2) = C(5,1) + C(5,2) = 5 + 10 = 15\nsymmetry: C(6,2) = C(6,4) = 15\nC(30,15): Pascal table 155117520, multiplicative 155117520\nC(60,30): Pascal table 118264581564861424, multiplicative 118264581564861424\n(60! itself has 82 digits, so n!/(k!(n-k)!) cannot work in 64 bits)",
